## Database Tables for External Data

### ExternalCompany Table

The `ExternalCompany` table is the **single source of truth** for all external company data:

```prisma
model ExternalCompany {
  id                String   @id @default(uuid())
  name              String
  slug              String   @unique
  
  // ATS Configuration
  atsProvider       ATSProvider  // COMEET, GREENHOUSE, LEVER, etc.
  atsCompanyId      String       // Company ID in the ATS
  atsToken          String?      // Public API token
  
  // Company Metadata (enriched from Crunchbase, LinkedIn, etc.)
  description       String?
  industry          String?
  size              CompanySizeCategory?  // STARTUP, MIDSIZE, ENTERPRISE
  employeeCountMin  Int?
  employeeCountMax  Int?
  fundingStage      String?
  totalFunding      String?
  headquarters      String?
  website           String?
  
  // Status and Discovery
  status            ExternalCompanyStatus  // ACTIVE, INACTIVE, INVALID, PENDING
  discoverySource   String?  // "google_search", "manual", "migration"
  lastEnrichedAt    DateTime?
  
  // ... more fields
}
```

