## Discovery Pattern

Use the `externalCompanyService.runDiscovery()` method to automatically discover new companies:

```typescript
// Discover new Comeet companies via Google Search
const newCompanies = await externalCompanyService.runDiscovery([
  'Israel tech startup',
  'Israel cybersecurity',
  'Israel fintech'
]);
```

---

## Enrichment Pattern

Use Crunchbase and other sources to keep company data fresh:

```typescript
// Enrich a single company
await externalCompanyService.enrichFromCrunchbase(companyId);

// Refresh stale companies (older than 7 days)
await externalCompanyService.refreshCompanyData(50); // max 50 companies
```

