## Admin API Endpoints

| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `/api/admin/companies` | GET | List all companies with filters |
| `/api/admin/companies/:id` | GET | Get single company |
| `/api/admin/companies` | POST | Create new company |
| `/api/admin/companies/:id` | PUT | Update company |
| `/api/admin/companies/:id` | DELETE | Delete company |
| `/api/admin/companies/:id/verify` | POST | Verify ATS credentials |
| `/api/admin/companies/:id/enrich` | POST | Enrich from Crunchbase |
| `/api/admin/discovery/run` | POST | Run discovery for new companies |
| `/api/admin/migration/hardcoded-companies` | POST | Migrate hardcoded to DB |
| `/api/admin/stats/companies` | GET | Get company statistics |

