## Checklist for Adding New External Data Sources

When adding a new external data source (e.g., new job board, new product catalog):

- [ ] **Create database model** in `prisma/schema.prisma`
- [ ] **Run migration**: `npx prisma migrate dev --name add_your_model`
- [ ] **Create service** with CRUD operations and discovery methods
- [ ] **Add fallback list** for initial data / offline mode
- [ ] **Create migration endpoint** to move hardcoded data to database
- [ ] **Add admin endpoints** for management
- [ ] **Document the source** in service JSDoc comments
- [ ] **Add tests** for database operations and fallback behavior

