## Why This Matters

| Hardcoded | Database-Driven |
| :--- | :--- |
| Requires code deployment to update | Update at runtime via API |
| Data becomes stale quickly | Automated enrichment keeps data fresh |
| Limited to developer knowledge | Discovery finds new sources automatically |
| Difficult to track changes | Full audit trail in database |
| No user management | Admin UI for CRUD operations |
